# Plugins Secondary Repo — Docs Sync

Platform documentation is authored in `docs/` at the cursorskills repo root and mirrored to `plugins/docs/` for distribution via `responsum-team/plugins`.

## When to sync

After any commit that touches `docs/` (especially `ONBOARDING.md` or runbooks).

## Steps

```bash
./scripts/sync_onboarding_docs.sh
./scripts/sync_plugins_secondary_repo.sh
```

Requires `PAT2` in `.env`. Never force-push to `responsum-team/plugins`.

## Rules

- Edit docs only in `docs/` — not directly in `plugins/docs/` (overwritten by sync).
- The plugins repo may also contain `skills/`, `rules/`, and `mcps/` assembled separately; this rule covers `docs/` only.
